<title>ISRAEL: Announcement on Netanyahu expected at 1530 GMT.</title>
<headline>Announcement on Netanyahu expected at 1530 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli prosecutors hope to announce their decision whether to charge Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu in a corruption scandal at 1530 GMT on Sunday, the Justice Ministry said.</p>
<p>Ministry spokeswoman Etty Eshed told reporters: &quot;We hope to conduct a news conference starting at 6:30 (1530 GMT) after we finish our preparations.&quot;</p>
</text>
